  "description": "The Ambient takes geometry and spec cues from Fuji's Tahoe model and ups the ante with Bosch e-bike pedal-assist systems. The Ambient is the perfect bike for the trail rider getting back into riding after a long hiatus, the older rider who needs a little help on a long climb as well as the husband or wife looking to keep up with his or her spouse. A2-SL alloy frame that is both strong and lightweight. Boost 148x12 rear hub spacing stiffens the Ambient's chassis and increases confidence when cornering and on high-speed descents. 100mm-travel fork smooths out the bumps, and remote lockout allows for quick switches in changing terrain. Bosch Performance CX pedal assist system delivers up to 500 watts of power Bosch Intuvia display Shimano hydraulic disc brakes provide superior stopping power in all weather conditions. 27.5-plus wheels/tires provides massive traction and increased stability",
